    "sub_title": "專案管理與AI協作",
    "sub_title_en": null,
    "sub_describe": "1.傳統專案管理的五大過程組與十大知識領域之系統架構內容\n2.敏捷專案管理價值館與原則及敏捷專案管理方法\n3..如何有效透過AI協作提升專案管理效能",
    "sub_describe_en": null
  },
  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "專案管理與AI協作",
    "sub_ename": "PROJECT MANAGEMENT AND AI COLLABORATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程結合專案管理理論與人工智慧工具應用，培養學生在多變環境中進行專案規劃、執行與監控的能力。課程涵蓋敏捷與傳統專案管理方法，並導入AI協作平台與工具，強化學生在跨領域團隊中的溝通、決策與問題解決能力及認證考試準備，目標是協助學生取得專案管理相關專業證照。",
    "describe_eh": "This course integrates project management theories with the application of artificial intelligence tools to develop students’ capabilities in planning, executing, and monitoring projects in dynamic environments. It covers both agile and traditional project management approaches and introduces AI collaboration platforms and tools to enhance communication, decision-making, and problem-solving skills in interdisciplinary teams, and certification exam preparation to help students obtain project management qualifications.",
